,"flickr_url":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/earthwandering/15764144445/","height":3867,"id":"15764144445","kind":"photo","license":"All Rights Reserved","original":"originals/15764144445/15764144445_f4bbb559b9_o.jpg","sha256":"07d1776a47f1489648072288b4e7e713590fc832cf6e7aae9f35f6103a6edb98","tags":[],"taken":"2014-09-03 13:56:50","title":"IMG_9448","uploaded":"2014-11-11 03:11:26","width":2901},"15764148665":{"albums":[{"id":"72157643911711523","position":2230}],"bytes":6943878,"camera_position":2230,"comments":[],"description":"","detail":"photos/0036.json","filename":"15764148665_162a629b19_o.jpg","flickr_url":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/earthwandering/15764148665/","height":2441,"id":"15764148665","kind":"photo","license":"All Rights Reserved","original":"originals/15764148665/15764148665_162a629b19_o.jpg","sha256":"adf3b7595c612795e4269eeebe3cd24324b3c644dbcd315736a6b248cfc139e8","tags":[],"taken":"2014-09-02 16:06:45","title":"IMG_9394","uploaded":"2014-11-11 03:12:21","width":3999},"15764152385":{"albums":[{"id":"72157643911711523","position":2228}],"bytes":9808994,"camera_position":2228,"comments":[{"author":"66325452@N02","date":"2015-02-26 08:05:22","text":"Speaking of lashing, George is a friend of mine www.flickr.com/photos/tellytomtelly/sets/72157629447998793/"},{"author":"100330886@N04","date":"2015-02-26 09:09:23","text":"Crazy!  That's pretty funny.  Small world, my grandfather, Bill Laughlin, knew him.  Let George know that Bill's grandson, Jon said hello.  :)  You have some great pics!"},{"author":"100330886@N04","date":"2015-02-26 09:10:39","text":"The use of the word \"cryptozoic\" from this book definitely stuck with me."},{"author":"66325452@N02","date":"2015-02-26 10:43:57","text":"George had and has such great respect for your Grandfather, me too having heard some of George's stories and looked through his collection of Bill Laughlin materials (including video). No doubt he is somewhat responsible for your see and understand the world path that you are on. Next time I see George I will let him know."},{"author":"100330886@N04","date":"2015-02-26 11:17:55","text":"It is so funny finding a connection through Flickr like this.  Bill was an amazing grandfather and yeah, he had a huge impact on me.  I was lucky enough to help return a lot of his collections to the Aleutian Islands and subsequently got to work on a couple of digs up there."}],"description":"","detail":"photos/0036.json","filename":"15764152385_8bfb464269_o.jpg","flickr_url":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/earthwandering/15764152385/","height":4000,"id":"15764152385","kind":"photo","license":"All Rights Reserved","original":"originals/15764152385/15764152385_8bfb464269_o.jpg","sha256":"45c9a6de21d15cc4dbf08270775bdbd8aa591b586d04223fc54074e80c8de9e7","tags":[],"taken":"2014-09-02 12:06:54","title":"IMG_9381","uploaded":"2014-11-11 03:13:11","width":3000},"15764164515":{"albums":[{"id":"72157643911711523","position":2219}],"bytes":10604704,"camera_position":2219,"comments":[],"description":"","detail":"photos/0036.json","filename":"15764164515_50beec86a9_o.jpg","flickr_url":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/earthwandering/15764164515/","height":4000,"id":"15764164515","kind":"photo","license":"All Rights Reserved","original":"originals/15764164515/15764164515_50beec86a9_o.jpg","sha256":"98f7f07c54f22bc625597e18eaf3f399fd4d9e336bf230e25c7c3b139ba62fe1","tags":[],"taken":"2014-08-29 14:03:53","title":"IMG_9269","uploaded":"2014-11-11 03:15:58","width":3000},"15764190225":{"albums":[{"id":"72157643911711523","position":2199},{"id":"72157649645054463","position":69},{"id":"72157662632925596","position":115}],"bytes":7604140,"camera_position":2199,"comments":[],"description":"","detail":"photos/0036.json","filename":"15764190225_58dd084f7e_o.jpg","flickr_url":"https://www.flickr.com/photos/earthwandering/15764190225/","height":1992,"id":"15764190225","kind":"photo","license":"All Rights Reserved","original":"originals/15764190225/15764190225_58dd084